#. Translators: Search terms to find this application. Do NOT translate or localize the semicolons! The list MUST also end with a semicolon!
#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.desktop.in.in:12
msgid "Gnome;GTK;audio;sharing;sound;"
msgstr "Gnome;GTK;audioa;partekatzea;soinua;"

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:6
msgid "Share your computer audio"
msgstr "Partekatu zure ordenagailuko audioa"

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:8
msgid "Felix Häcker"
msgstr "Felix Häcker"

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:16
msgid ""
"With Audio Sharing you can share your current computer audio playback in the "
"form of an RTSP stream. This stream can then be played back by other "
"devices, for example using VLC."
msgstr "Audio Sharing aplikazioaren bidez, ordenagailuko audioaren erreprodukzioa partekatu daiteke RTSP korronte gisa. Korronte hori beste gailu batzuetan erreproduzitu daiteke, adibidez VLC erabiliz."

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:19
msgid ""
"By sharing the audio as a network stream, you can also use common devices "
"that are not intended to be used as audio sinks (eg. smartphones) to receive "
"it. For example, there are audio accessories that are not compatible with "
"desktop computers (e.g. because the computer does not have a Bluetooth "
"module installed). With the help of this app, the computer audio can be "
"played back on a smartphone, which is then connected to the Bluetooth "
"accessory."
msgstr "Audioa sareko korronte gisa partekatuz, aundio-kolektore gisa erabiltzeko pentsatuta ez dauden gailu arruntak ere erabili daitezke, adibidez mugikor adimentsuak.  Adibidez, badaude mahaigaineko ordenagailuekin bateragarriak ez diren audio-osagarriak (esaterako, ordenagailuak ez duelako Bluetooth modulurik instalatuta). Aplikazio honen laguntzaren bidez, ordenagailuko audioa mugikor batean erreproduzitu daiteke, eta hori Bluetooth osagarriarekin konektatu daiteke."

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:28
msgid "Main window light"
msgstr "Leiho nagusi argia"

#: data/de.haeckerfelix.AudioSharing.metainfo.xml.in.in:32
msgid "Main window dark"
msgstr "Leiho nagusi iluna"

#: data/gtk/window.ui:27
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "Menua"

#: data/gtk/window.ui:87
msgid "Copy to Clipboard"
msgstr "Kopiatu arbelean"

#: data/gtk/window.ui:98
msgid ""
"You are currently sharing your audio. You can access it from other devices "
"in the same network by scanning the QR code or entering the displayed "
"address in a playback app that supports RTSP streams. This device can be "
"muted, the audio will still be shared.\n"
"\n"
"To stop sharing, simply close this window."
msgstr "Audioa partekatzen ari zara. Sare bereko beste gailuetatik atzitzeko, eskaneatu QR kodea edo sartu bistaratutako helbidea RTSP korronteak onartzen dituen erreprodukzio-aplikazio batean. Gailu hau mututu daiteke, baina audioa hala ere partekatua izaten jarraituko du.\n"
"\n"
"Partekatzea gelditzeko, itxi leiho hau."

#: data/gtk/window.ui:120
msgid "Unable to Share Audio"
msgstr "Ezin da audioa partekatu"

#: data/gtk/window.ui:145
msgid "Open _Help <sup>↗</sup>"
msgstr "Ireki _laguntza <sup>↗</sup>"

#: data/gtk/window.ui:152
msgid "_About Audio Sharing"
msgstr "Audio Sharing aplikazioari _buruz"

#: src/ui/about_window.rs:35
msgid "Share computer audio"
msgstr "Partekatu ordenagailuko audioa"

#: src/ui/about_window.rs:45
msgid "translator-credits"
msgstr "translator-credits"

#: src/ui/window.rs:83
msgid "Copied address to clipboard"
msgstr "Helbidea arbelean kopiatu da"

#: src/app.rs:144
msgid "A client has established a connection"
msgstr "Bezero batek konexio bat ezarri du"

#: src/app.rs:145
msgid "Audio playback from this device gets shared."
msgstr "Gailu honetako audio-erreprodukzioa partekatzen ari da."
